  <tr ID="problem-1">
    <td>Multiple sclerosis diagnosed elsewhere, by her account, with records of the original evaluation not available: slowly worsening walking over the past few years, leg stiffness, fatigue, urinary urgency and heat sensitivity; uses a cane; course to be classified after MRI of the brain and spine</td><td>resolved</td><td>confirmed</td>
