    <td>Active primary progressive multiple sclerosis: gradual worsening of walking over more than a year without relapses, with brain lesions in periventricular, juxtacortical and infratentorial regions, three spinal cord lesions, and one gadolinium-enhancing lesion; fulfils the 2017 McDonald criteria for primary progressive disease; EDSS 6.0; synthetic modern detail linked to her publicly reported multiple sclerosis</td><td>active</td><td>confirmed</td>
